data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "designer-1", "text": "Drafted 'rb87_sas_and_doublepass_aom_two_lane' on a 550x300 mm plate: 4x pbs, 4x mirror, 4x beam dump, 2x half wave plate, 2x sampler, 2x photodiode, 1x isolator, 1x vapor cell, 1x aom, 1x lens, 1x quarter wave plate, 1x fiber coupler. Parallel Two-Lane Horizontal Layout for a 780.24 nm Rb-87 laser system. The ECDL output passes through an optical isolator and a HWP+PBS pickoff that routes ~10% of"}

