data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "designer-3", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_aom_doublepass_uturn' on a 550x300 mm plate: 6x mirror, 4x pbs, 3x beam dump, 2x half wave plate, 2x sampler, 2x photodiode, 1x isolator, 1x vapor cell, 1x aom, 1x lens, 1x quarter wave plate, 1x fiber coupler. Compact Folded U-Turn Layout for Rb-87 780.24 nm laser locking and +160 MHz double-pass AOM fiber delivery. The laser travels along the top rail (+x) through an isolator and"}

