data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "repair-1", "text": "Rationale: Moved the 0th-order razor block (BD_AOM0) onto the actual focused 0th-order beam path at (435.0, 55.904) so it absorbs the forward 0th-order beam before M_RETRO, eliminating the return L1.t.t.0.+1.r.t ghost that passed through FC1's mount, and cleaned up redundant unused dumps."}

